Package: fastDist
Type: Package
Title: Fast Pairwise Distances Between the Rows of Two Matrices
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 2026-07-04
Authors@R:
    person("Vicente", "Castellar Sebastia", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "vic.sebastia@gmail.com")
Description: Fast computation of pairwise distances between the rows of two
    matrices. A single entry point, fdist(), dispatches to C++ backends
    (built on 'RcppArmadillo', parallelised with 'OpenMP' where available)
    for a wide range of distance metrics: Euclidean, Manhattan, Minkowski,
    correlation, cosine, Canberra, supremum, squared Euclidean, Bray-Curtis,
    Hellinger, chi-squared, Jensen-Shannon, Haversine, standardized
    Euclidean, Spearman, Mahalanobis, Hamming, Jaccard and Gower distances.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/vcastellar/fastDist
BugReports: https://github.com/vcastellar/fastDist/issues
